# Playwright visual tests (ysk.bel)

## Layout

- **Site DOM** (ids, `data-*`, shared classes): `src/scripts/constants/homePageDom.cjs` — imported by bundled JS (`videoShowcaseCarousel`, `addVideo`, `googleMapInit`) and **reused from tests** via `require()` in `tests/visual/constants.js`.
- **Test-only**: `tests/visual/constants.js` — `VIEWPORTS`, `BLOCKED_THIRD_PARTY_URL_GLOBS`, screenshot timeouts, `LAYOUT.footerMinVisibleWidthPx`.
- **Shared waits / routing**: `tests/visual/support/home-snapshot-helpers.cjs`.
- **Specs**: `tests/visual/home-header.spec.js` (header + mobile drawer), `tests/visual/home-sections.spec.js` (remaining sections).
- **Baselines**: `tests/visual/home-snapshots/*.png` — `snapshotPathTemplate` in `playwright.config.mjs` uses this single folder for all home specs; omits `{platform}` (shared macOS/Linux baselines).
- **Config**: `playwright.config.mjs` loads `VIEWPORTS` via `createRequire` from `tests/visual/constants.js`.

## Commands

- `yarn test:visual` — run against `yarn build` + static server (see `webServer` in config).
- `yarn test:visual:update` — refresh PNGs after **intentional** UI changes; commit diffs for review.
- `yarn test:visual:ui` / `yarn test:visual:report` — UI mode / HTML report.

## Behaviour notes

- Footer screenshot is **skipped** when viewport width `< 768` (`.footer-social` hidden in CSS).
- **Header — mobile menu open** runs only below 768px; dismiss info-banner overlay first (`dismissInfoBannerForInteraction`) so `.navbar-toggler` is clickable.
- Waits: stocking zoom `is-loaded`, video host `is-media-ready` / `readyState`, map `#map` → `map-shell--ready`.
- Third-party blocking for stability: list in `BLOCKED_THIRD_PARTY_URL_GLOBS` (not maps/video CDN).

## CI

- **Build** job: `yarn build`, then `yarn test:unit` (Vitest).
- **Visual** job (PRs only): path filter or `run-visual` label; `yarn exec playwright install …`, `yarn test:visual`; uploads `playwright-report` on failure.

